  "reference": "This file exists to pin the CONSEQUENCE of the un-gate rather than an intermediate. Through P5 the seasonal branch was a silent no-op, so the AMS frame stayed empty, the two seasonal GEV marginals were left NaN-parameterized, and Validate() reported missing seasonal data. Every assertion here would have failed then: the model validates, and a seeded draw off its two-season competing-risks distribution is a finite number the C# reproduces. The Simulation target is used rather than MaximumLikelihood because an eight-parameter seasonal fit on thirty synthetic observations is not a convergence test (the same reason plotting_position.json uses it), and the seasonal path is reachable under any target.",
